        "kind": "setting-ignored",
        "exposedClass": "action-required",
        "statement": "After upgrading to Cilium 1.17, an environment still setting any of the removed metallb-bgp flags bgp-config-path, bgp-announce-lb-ip or bgp-announce-pod-cidr will no longer have those settings honoured; the upgrade notes state that users are now required to use the Cilium BGP control plane for BGP advertisements.",
